Build-Chain aus upstream master (PR #89, 2026-11-15): Cherry-Pick von d5b6409a
"Build with GCC 13+: drop -ffreestanding, add -D_GLIBCXX_USE_STD_SPEC_FUNCS=0".
Nur Compiler-Flags in Hardware/*.mk (fuer das AC/DC: Hardware/xibeca.mk). Upstream: mit GCC 12.3 bytegleich.
Quelle: https://github.com/RebelTechnology/OpenWare/commit/d5b6409a9953c0474b522fa9b8295ad101b33598

